# Typography

Follow `Rules.md` at the repo root. Summary for agents:

## Admin / dashboard (`(admin)`, `components/admin/**`, dialogs)

Use Tailwind shadcn tokens only:

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page title | `text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight` |
| Subtitle | `text-sm text-muted-foreground` |
| Site header | `text-base font-medium` |
| Body / table / form / dialog | `text-sm` |
| Table head | `text-sm font-medium` |
| Weights | `font-medium` or `font-semibold` — avoid `font-bold` |

Do **not** use `type-*` utilities or arbitrary sizes like `text-[13px]` in admin UI.

## Member (`app/member/**`, `components/member/**`)

Prefer existing `type-*` scale from `globals.css` (`type-body`, `type-ui`, `type-title`, `type-display`, …).

## Examples

```tsx
// ✅
<h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Daftar Pengguna</h2>
<p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Manage users</p>

// ❌ admin
<p className="type-body">…</p>
<span className="text-[15px]">…</span>
```
